================================================================================
Pollen Robotics Attribution & Upstream Crates
================================================================================

QuackDeck links against and interoperates with upstream Microduck protocol
crates created by Pollen Robotics (https://github.com/pollen-robotics/microduck):

  - duck-auth
  - duck-ble
  - duck-ipc-proto

These upstream crates are Copyright Pollen Robotics and are licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

QuackDeck's BLE advertisement wrapper (rust/quackdeck-core/src/adv.rs) also
normalizes 9-byte Apple-joined CoreBluetooth manufacturer payloads emitted by
boards with BlueZ device privacy disabled before forwarding them to duck-ble.

QuackDeck's wire data models (ios/QuackDeck/Bridge/ProtoModels.swift) and state
machine documentation (docs/robot-state-machine.md) implement interoperability
with Pollen Robotics' Microduck JSON-RPC protocol. QuackDeck's dark cockpit
palette also draws visual inspiration from Pollen Robotics' microduck-simulator
(https://huggingface.co/spaces/pollen-robotics/microduck-simulator).

Pollen Robotics' 3D CAD / STL model files in pollen-robotics/microduck_rl
(separately licensed under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0) and Pollen Robotics logos or brand
assets are NOT included in QuackDeck.

